+> This curated list of the best AI tools for small businesses in 2026 focuses only on open source projects that exist as public GitHub repositories. Every entry below is GitHub-native, self-hostable or developer-extensible, and chosen for practical small-business use cases such as workflow automation, customer support, document handling, analytics, and content production.
