+#### [Activepieces](https://github.com/activepieces/activepieces)
+> **Description:** Activepieces positions itself around AI agents, MCP support, and workflow automation, with a strong emphasis on no-code and low-code business processes. Its README and repo metadata highlight hundreds of integrations and AI-focused orchestration patterns that make it suitable for small companies replacing repetitive ops work. It is particularly relevant for founders or operations teams that want Zapier-like behavior while retaining GitHub-visible code and self-hosting options. GitHub marks the repository license as `Other`, so teams should review the project license terms directly before production use.
