+> **Description:** Flowise markets itself simply as “Build AI Agents, Visually,” and that sums up why it is useful for small businesses. The project focuses on low-code orchestration for chatbots, RAG pipelines, and multi-step agent workflows, making it easier to prototype internal assistants, customer support flows, or document Q&A without starting from raw framework code. Its README emphasizes flexible LLM, RAG, and workflow support, while the repo’s large community footprint suggests strong ecosystem momentum. GitHub currently labels the license as `Other`, so teams should check the exact licensing text before commercial rollout.
