+> **Description:** Langflow’s README describes it as a platform for building and deploying AI-powered agents and workflows with a visual authoring experience, built-in API support, MCP server support, and integrations across major models and vector databases. That makes it a strong fit for small businesses that want something more developer-friendly than pure no-code tools but still faster than writing everything from scratch. The project also exposes flows as APIs and tools, which is valuable when you need an internal assistant to connect with a website, help desk, or inventory process. The repository is MIT licensed.
